      ["سوا پانچ بجے","savā pā̃ch baje","at a quarter past five","سوا = plus a quarter."],
      ["پونے دس بجے","paune das baje","at a quarter to ten","پونے = minus a quarter."],
      ["آج کیا دن ہے؟","āj kyā din hai?","What day is it today?","|"],
      ["آج اتوار ہے۔","āj itvār hai.","Today is Sunday.","Sunday is the weekly day off in Pakistan."],
      ["پیر کو","pīr ko","on Monday","The other days: منگل, بدھ, جمعرات, جمعہ, ہفتہ, اتوار."],
      ["رات کو","rāt ko","at night","Parts of the day take کو too: صبح کو, شام کو."],
      ["دس منٹ میں","das minaṭ mẽ","in ten minutes","The postposition میں comes after the time."],
      ["پرسوں","parsõ","the day after tomorrow; the day before yesterday","Like کل, the verb tells you which."],
      ["میں نو بجے کام پر جاتی ہوں۔","maĩ nau baje kām par jātī hū̃.","I go to work at nine. (a woman speaking)","A man: جاتا ہوں. Time comes before the place."],
      ["میں رات کو دیر سے سوتا ہوں۔","maĩ rāt ko der se sotā hū̃.","I go to bed late. (a man speaking)","A woman: سوتی ہوں. دیر سے = late."],
      ["میں کل آؤں گا۔","maĩ kal āū̃ gā.","I'll come tomorrow. (a man speaking)","A woman: آؤں گی. With the future, کل means tomorrow."]
